# Ansible Apache Deployment Lab

## About This Lab

In this lab, I used WSL (Ubuntu) as the Ansible control node and an AWS EC2 Ubuntu server as the managed node.

The goal was to use Ansible to install Apache and deploy a simple HTML webpage on the EC2 server.

## Lab Setup

Windows
   |
   └── WSL (Ubuntu)
          |
          | SSH
          |
          ↓
      AWS EC2
      Ubuntu
          |
          ├── Apache2
          └── index.html

### Components Used

* Windows
* WSL with Ubuntu
* Ansible
